ard is a book author and the  implicit  understanding with his sources is that  he'll interview them  interview them again and again and again  until he can stitch together  something authoritative in book form so  where do i come down on this  i believe that the strongest counter  argument  is that it is very plausible  that donald trump never would have been  interviewed by  bob woodward in other words he never  would have accepted sitting down with  bob woodward  if he had known that bob woodward was  going to publish some of this stuff  right away  i think that that's a realistic thing if  bob woodward  says i want to interview you but i might  just publish this stuff next week  trump probably refuses the interview the  pretext of accepting the interview  likely included um the the belief that  this would not be published until it  came out in a book months later  now bob woodward could have made the  decision even though my intent was not  to publish this stuff right away  this is of such public health importance  this is of such national importance  that i have to go public with this  that's something that bob woodward  could have done the question then  becomes would it actually have saved  lives  i don't know that it would have now let  me walk you through my thinking  it seems obvious if donald trump  had publicly taken the virus seriously  starting in february  rather than denying its seriousness a  lot of his followers would have taken it  more seriously  and thus fewer people would have died  that i think is true  the problem is what we're talking about  is not  trump publicly taking it more seriously  what we're talking about is  in march for example bob woodward  blowing the whistle and saying hey  trump's lying  i have him on tape i caught him  red-handed i don't believe that would  have made a difference to trump's  followers and why don't i believe that  because it hasn't made a difference so  far  trump has gotten caught red-handed doing  everything you can imagine and his  supporters by and large  have not punished him nothing happens  now we'll see in just over seven weeks  whether  in total trump is held accountable for  this disastrous four years but i have a  hard time imagining that even if bob  woodward did go public  in march with this saying whoa whoa whoa  hold on a second stop the clock  i have audio trump knows this is serious  trump would come out and just insult  everybody  kaylee magnani would have come out and  done a press briefing and come up with  some rationale for why this is not a big  deal  and then people would have moved on to  the next scandal sort of how  we are now moving on to this one from  dead soldiers or suckers and losers from  just a few days ago  so if i were bob woodward me personally  i would have come forward because i  would want to clear my own conscience  that's me  do i think it would have made a  substantive difference  i have a hard time thinking it would  have because it would be just like when  any journalist comes out with anything  about donald trump  his followers either don't believe it or  ignore it  or write it off or whatever so um  if it were me i would have come come  public because of my own conscience i  don't know that it really would have  made a difference  we're going to explore this in more  detail on the david pakman show  instagram i hope you were following us  there at david pakman show we're going  to take a quick break  and next i am going to dive into some  new policy proposals from joe biden  we will look at a very strange interview  that donald trump gave to sean hannity  last night  and so much more one of our sponsors  today is  monk pack keto granola bars and they are  giving you 20  off when you go to davidpakman.com snack  and use the coupon code pacman you know  a lot of these  uh low carb snack bars have a reputation  for not tasting great  but i can tell you from trying these  myself that that is not the case with  the monk pack  keto granola bars they taste just as  good  if not better than the sugar-filled  chewy granola  bars that many of us love but these  contain only one gram  of sugar two net carbs only 140 calories  they're completely plant-based and  gluten-free  great for anybody following a low-carb  diet  but also perfect for anybody like me  who's just trying to  reduce sugar intake which i think is a  good thing i've been working  on a box of these at home they're  delicious soft  chewy texture bunch of great flavors  including peanut butter coconut cocoa  chip which is my personal favorite it's  great for a quick breakfast  a snack in the afternoon i have been  loving these  you can get to their website by going to  davidpakman.com  snack the link is under this video and  you'll get twenty percent off when you  use the coupon code  pacman
 

